ched on and off individually in the PID algorithm. P-action is on when the \u0022Enable P-action\u0022 input is set.","DescriptionOther":"Die PID-Aktionen k\u00F6nnen im PID-Algorithmus einzeln ein- und ausgeschaltet werden. Die P-Aktion ist eingeschaltet, wenn der Eingang \u201EP-Aktion aktivieren\u201C gesetzt ist.","DescriptionTemplateKey":"","DescriptionTemplateOptOut":false,"DescriptionDirty":false,"HasValidationError":false},{"Id":616,"PlcStructure":"PID_WATER_LEVEL","PlcName":"I_SEL","SystemNameEnglish":"","NameEnglish":"Water level PID I-action on","SystemNameOther":"","NameOther":"Wasserstand PID I-action EIN","Unit":"0","TrueText":"","ModuleName":"","ModulePort":null,"EplanSignal":"","EplanConnectedTo":"","ColorValue0":"","ColorValue1":"","AlarmConfig":"","AlarmInvert":"","AlarmId":"","ExtraColumn1":"","ExtraColumn2":"","LoggingEnable":"","LoggingTime":"","Type":"","AlarmControl":"","SrAlarm":"","AlarmClass":"","ReactToUnit":"","Spare":"","BlockingClass1":"","BlockingClass2":"","Delay":"","TimeBase":"","SourceType":"","SourceDigId":"","SourceAnaId":"","Used":"1","InUse":"1","ParameterType":"1","IntegerValue":"1","TimeValue":"T#0MS","RealValue":"0.0","MinValue":"0.0","MaxValue":"0.0","LimitLlEnabled":false,"LimitLoEnabled":false,"LimitHiEnabled":false,"LimitHhEnabled":false,"AlarmErrId":"","AlarmLlId":"","AlarmLoId":"","AlarmHiId":"","AlarmHhId":"","ParVal1Id":"","ParVal2Id":"","ParOffsetId":"","ParScaleFactorId":"","ParLlId":"","ParLoId":"","ParHiId":"","ParHhId":"","Ordinator":"","DescriptionEnglish":"The PID actions can be switched on and off individually in the PID algorithm. I action is on when the input \u0022I-action on\u0022 is set.","DescriptionOther":"Die PID-Aktionen k\u00F6nnen im PID-Algorithmus einzeln ein- und ausgeschaltet werden. I-Aktion ist eingeschaltet, wenn der Eingang \u201EI-Aktion ein\u201C gesetzt ist.","DescriptionTemplateKey":"","DescriptionTemplateOptOut":false,"DescriptionDirty":false,"HasValidationError":false},{"Id":617,"PlcS