","750":"Spare","751":"Spare","752":"Spare","753":"Spare","754":"Alarm is triggered when the measurement surpasses a threshold set to be excessively high in the system parameters, or digital signal is indicating that the measured value has very high value.","755":"Spare","756":"Spare","757":"Spare","758":"Spare","759":"Spare","760":"Spare","761":"Spare","762":"Spare","763":"Spare","764":"Spare","765":"Spare","766":"Spare","767":"Spare","768":"Detects a break in the measurement wiring on the current side 1.","769":"Detects a break in the measurement wiring on the current side 2.","770":"Monitors incorrect phase sequence.","771":"Detects and protects against phase voltage imbalance or overvoltage.","772":"Protects against against short circuits with a time delay.","773":"Instantaneous short-circuit protection, triggered by high fault currents.","774":"Protects against fault overcurrent on the transformer side in the first stage.","775":"Protects against fault overcurrent on the transformer side in the second stage.","776":"Protects the equipment against thermal overloads.","777":"Detects and protects against undervoltage in the first stage.","778":"Detects and protects against undervoltage in the second stage.","779":"Detects and protects against overvoltage condition in the first stage.","780":"Detects and protects against overvoltage condition in the second stage.","781":"Detects and protects against system underfrequency in the first stage.","782":"Detects and protects against system underfrequency in the second stage.","783":"Detects and protects against system overfrequency in the first stage.","784":"Detects and protects against system overfrequency in the second stage.","785":"Detects reverse power flow to prevent generator motoring.","786":"Protects against thermal effects of load imbalance in the first stage.","787":"Detects and protects against excessive excitation levels in the first stage.","788":"Protects against thermal damage due to excessive excitation