to the next point.","528":"0 - Synchronizer giving up/down signals, 1 - Speed reference following grid frequency","529":"Value that declares the increment of speed reference due to synchronizer command.","530":"Value that declares the reference of the deflector valve at minimum power before switching on the regulation.","531":"Value that declares the reference of the synchronization nozzle at minimum power before switching on the regulation.","532":"1 - Water level, 3 - Active power, 4 - Position ","533":"Value that declares ramp time of first valve in case of normal shutdown.","534":"Value that declares ramp time of first valve in case of quick shutdown.","535":"Value that declares ramp time of first valve in case of emergency shutdown.","536":"Value that declares ramp time of second valve in case of normal shutdown.","537":"Value that declares ramp time of second valve in case of quick shutdown.","538":"Value that declares ramp time of second valve in case of emergency shutdown.","539":"","540":"","541":"A value that declares the speed below which a turbine fault is considered if this speed is not reached within the given time.","542":"Value that declares minimal openness of valves while power plant is connected to the grid.","543":"Value that declares minimal water level below which shutdown is activated. Power plant restarts automatically when water level rises above given limit.","544":"Value that declares maximal water level at which Auto Restart is initiated. ","545":"Low value for analog control for the Turbine","546":"High value for analog control for the Turbine","547":"","548":"Scaling factor for analog control for the Turbine","549":"Parameter used to declare lowest value of analog control signal range.","550":"Parameter used to declare highest value of analog control signal range.","551":"Constant value added to or subtracted from control signal to shift it to the desired reference point.","552":"Constant multiplier used to scale or transform the magnitude of the control signal to achieve the desired system response.","553":"","554":"","555":"","556":"","557":"","558":"","559":"","560":"","561":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 1 at which nozzle 2 is deactivated.","562":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 1 at which nozzle 2 is activated.","563":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 2 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","564":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 2 at which nozzle 3 is deactivated.","565":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 2 at which nozzle 3 is activated.","566":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 3 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","567":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 3 at which nozzle 4 is deactivated.","568":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 3 at which nozzle 4 is activated.","569":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 4 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","570":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 4 at which nozzle 5 is deactivated.","571":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 4 at which nozzle 5 is activated.","572":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 5 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","573":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 5 at which nozzle 6 is deactivated.","574":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 5 at which nozzle 6 is activated.","575":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 6 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","576":"","577":"","578":"","579":"","580":"","581":"","582":"Maximal openness of the turbine during limiter active","583":"Maximal openness of the turbine during limiter not active","584":"Time needed for limiter to stop working after conditions for no limit are met","585":""