ue that is added to \u0022Nozzle 2 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","564":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 2 at which nozzle 3 is deactivated.","565":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 2 at which nozzle 3 is activated.","566":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 3 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","567":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 3 at which nozzle 4 is deactivated.","568":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 3 at which nozzle 4 is activated.","569":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 4 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","570":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 4 at which nozzle 5 is deactivated.","571":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 4 at which nozzle 5 is activated.","572":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 5 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","573":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 5 at which nozzle 6 is deactivated.","574":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 5 at which nozzle 6 is activated.","575":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 6 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","576":"","577":"","578":"","579":"","580":"","581":"","582":"","583":"","584":"","585":"","586":"","587":"","588":"","589":"","590":"","591":"","592":"","593":"","594":"","595":"","596":"","597":"","598":"","599":"","600":"","601":"","602":"","603":"","604":"","605":"","606":"","607":"","608":"Low limit of output value.","609":"High limit of output value.","610":"Limit for slew rate of the output value in second in positive range with falling absolute value.","611":"Limit for slew rate of the output value in second in positive range with rising absolute value.","612":"Limit for slew rat