itches to regulation mode.","196":"Defines down ramp time for Unit openness after swtich from regulation mode to start of shutdown sequence. Active only in switch from two to one unit operation. Purpose of down ramp time is that power plant keeps stable Active power value until the Unit that is stopping initiates stopping sequence.","197":"Defines openness setpoint from Common control Active power regulator above which value Common control sends request to the Unit with lower level of priority to start.","198":"Defines openness setpoint from Common control Active power regulator below which value Common control sends request to the Unit with lowest priority to stop.","199":"Defines time delay that is active from the moment when Common control sends start request to Unit. When defined time delay passes, Unit initiates starting sequence. Purpose of Start Unit delay timer is to eliminate unnecessary starting of the Unit if the conditions for starting the unit are transient.","200":"Defines time delay that is active from the moment when Common control sends stop request to Unit. When defined time delay passes, Unit initiates stopping sequence. Purpose of Stop Unit delay timer is to eliminate unnecessary stopping of the Unit if the conditions for stopping the unit are transient.","201":"","202":"","203":"","204":"","205":"","206":"","207":"","208":"","209":"","210":"","211":"","212":"","213":"","214":"","215":"","216":"","217":"","218":"","219":"","220":"","221":"","222":"","223":"","224":"Upper (high) limit for regulation.","225":"Area (from upper limit to lower limit) of regulation.","226":"Upper (high) limit for regulation.","227":"Area (from upper limit to lower limit) of regulation.","228":"Minimal pressure in waterway to allow the MIV to open.","229":"Maximal pressure difference between waterway and turbine to allow the MIV to open.","230":"Number of different waterway pressure measurements.","231":"","232":"","233":"","234":"","235":"","236":"","237":"","238":"","