24":"Value that declares speed in which \u0022speed up\u0022 transitions to the next point.","525":"Position of first valve in speed up.","526":"Position of second valve in speed up.","527":"Value that declares speed in which \u0022speed up\u0022 transitions to the next point.","528":"0 - Synchronizer giving up/down signals, 1 - Speed reference following grid frequency","529":"Value that declares the increment of speed reference due to synchronizer command.","530":"Value that declares the reference of the deflector valve at minimum power before switching on the regulation.","531":"Value that declares the reference of the synchronization nozzle at minimum power before switching on the regulation.","532":"1 - Water level, 3 - Active power, 4 - Position ","533":"Value that declares ramp time of first valve in case of normal shutdown.","534":"Value that declares ramp time of first valve in case of quick shutdown.","535":"Value that declares ramp time of first valve in case of emergency shutdown.","536":"Value that declares ramp time of second valve in case of normal shutdown.","537":"Value that declares ramp time of second valve in case of quick shutdown.","538":"Value that declares ramp time of second valve in case of emergency shutdown.","539":"","540":"","541":"A value that declares the speed below which a turbine fault is considered if this speed is not reached within the given time.","542":"Value that declares minimal openness of valves while power plant is connected to the grid.","543":"Value that declares minimal water level below which shutdown is activated. Power plant restarts automatically when water level rises above given limit.","544":"","545":"","546":"","547":"","548":"","549":"Parameter used to declare lowest value of analog control signal range.","550":"Parameter used to declare highest value of analog control signal range.","551":"Constant value added to or subtracted from control signal to shift it to the desired reference point.","552":"Constant mul