h it considers that the turbine speed is in overspeed 1.","357":"A value that indicates the speed limit above which it considers that the turbine speed is in overspeed 2.","358":"A value that indicates speed limit above \u0022standstill speed relay\u0022 value which it considers that the turbine is not longer in standstill.","359":"A value that indicates speed limit above \u0022brake speed relay\u0022 value which it considers that the turbine is not longer braking.","360":"A value that indicates speed limit below \u0022excitation speed relay\u0022 value which it considers that the excitation is not longer ready to be turned on.","361":"A value that indicates speed limit below \u0022synchronization speed relay\u0022 value which it considers that the synchronization is not ready to be performed.","362":"A value that indicates speed limit below \u0022overspeed 1 speed relay\u0022 value which it considers that the turbine is not longer in overspeed 1.","363":"A value that indicates speed limit below \u0022overspeed 2 speed relay\u0022 value which it considers that the turbine is not longer in overspeed 2.","364":"","365":"","366":"","367":"","368":"Parameter used to declare lowest value of measurement range.","369":"Parameter used to declare highest value of measurement range.","370":"Constant multiplier used to relate the value or reading obtained from a measurement instrument to the actual physical quantity being measured.","371":"Constant value added to or subtracted from a measurement or reading to shift it to the desired reference point or baseline.","372":"Parameter used to declare lowest value of measurement range.","373":"Parameter used to declare highest value of measurement range.","374":"Constant multiplier used to relate the value or reading obtained from a measurement instrument to the actual physical quantity being measured.","375":"Constant value added to or subtracted from a measurement or reading to shift it to the desired reference point or baseline.",