":"Parameter used to declare lowest value of analog control signal range.","550":"Parameter used to declare highest value of analog control signal range.","551":"Constant value added to or subtracted from control signal to shift it to the desired reference point.","552":"Constant multiplier used to scale or transform the magnitude of the control signal to achieve the desired system response.","553":"","554":"","555":"","556":"","557":"","558":"Ramping time which uses algoritam fo nozzle selection to keep constant flow during nozzle switching.","559":"Hysteresis of turbine flow on which algoritam of nozzle selection is deactivated.","560":"Maximal turbine flow","561":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 1 at which nozzle 2 is deactivated.","562":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 1 at which nozzle 2 is activated.","563":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 2 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","564":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 2 at which nozzle 3 is deactivated.","565":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 2 at which nozzle 3 is activated.","566":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 3 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","567":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 3 at which nozzle 4 is deactivated.","568":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 3 at which nozzle 4 is activated.","569":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 4 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","570":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 4 at which nozzle 5 is deactivated.","571":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 4 at which nozzle 5 is activated.","572":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 5 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","573":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 5 at which nozz