n turbine nozzle 6 position to shift it to the desired reference point.","491":"Constant multiplier used to relate the value or reading obtained from a measurement instrument to the actual physical quantity being measured.","492":"Parameter used to declare \u0022lowest\u0022 position value of pelton turbine deflector 1.","493":"Parameter used to declare \u0022highest\u0022 position value of pelton turbine deflector 1.","494":"Constant value added to or subtracted from a measurement of pelton turbine deflector 1 position to shift it to the desired reference point.","495":"Constant multiplier used to relate the value or reading obtained from a measurement instrument to the actual physical quantity being measured.","496":"Parameter used to declare \u0022lowest\u0022 position value of pelton turbine deflector 2.","497":"Parameter used to declare \u0022highest\u0022 position value of pelton turbine deflector 2.","498":"Constant value added to or subtracted from a measurement of pelton turbine deflector 2 position to shift it to the desired reference point.","499":"Constant multiplier used to relate the value or reading obtained from a measurement instrument to the actual physical quantity being measured.","500":"Parameter used to declare \u0022lowest\u0022 position value of pelton turbine deflector 3.","501":"Parameter used to declare \u0022highest\u0022 position value of pelton turbine deflector 3.","502":"Constant value added to or subtracted from a measurement of pelton turbine deflector 3 position to shift it to the desired reference point.","503":"Constant multiplier used to relate the value or reading obtained from a measurement instrument to the actual physical quantity being measured.","504":"","505":"","506":"","507":"","508":"","509":"","510":"","511":"","512":"Number of valves in turbine.","513":"Number of deflectors in turbine.","514":"Synchronization valve in pelton turbine. The number refers to a specific valve.","515":"Value that declares the position in which valve is considered to be closed. Applies to all valves.","516":"Value that declares the position in which valve is considered to be open. Applies to all valves","517":"","518":"","519":"Position of first valve in speed up.","520":"Position of second valve in speed up.","521":"Value that declares speed in which \u0022speed up\u0022 transitions to the next point.","522":"Position of first valve in speed up.","523":"Position of second valve in speed up.","524":"Value that declares speed in which \u0022speed up\u0022 transitions to the next point.","525":"Position of first valve in speed up.","526":"Position of second valve in speed up.","527":"Value that declares speed in which \u0022speed up\u0022 transitions to the next point.","528":"0 - Synchronizer giving up/down signals, 1 - Speed reference following grid frequency","529":"Value that declares the increment of speed reference due to synchronizer command.","530":"Value that declares the reference of the deflector valve at minimum power before switching on the regulation.","531":"Value that declares the reference of the synchronization nozzle at minimum power before switching on the regulation.","532":"1 - Water level, 3 - Active power, 4 - Position ","533":"Value that declares ramp time of first valve in case of normal shutdown.","534":"Value that declares ramp time of first valve in case of quick shutdown.","535":"Value that declares ramp time of first valve in case of emergency shutdown.","536":"Value that declares ramp time of second valve in case of normal shutdown.","537":"Value that declares ramp time of second valve in case of quick shutdown.","538":"Value that declares ramp time of second valve in case of emergency shutdown.","539":"","540":"","541":"A value that declares the speed below which a turbine fault is considered if this speed is not reached within the given time.","542":"Value that declares minimal openness of valves while power plant is connected to the grid.","543":"Value that declares minimal water level below which shutdown is activated. Power plant restarts automatically when water level rises above given limit.","544":"","545":"","546":"","547":"","548":"","549":"Parameter used to declare lowest value of analog control signal range.","550":"Parameter used to declare highest value of analog control signal range.","551":"Constant value added to or subtracted from control signal to shift it to the desired reference point.","552":"Constant multiplier used to scale or transform the magnitude of the control signal to achieve the desired system response.","553":"","554":"","555":"","556":"","557":"","558":"Ramping time which uses algoritam fo nozzle selection to keep constant flow during nozzle switching.","559":"Hysteresis of turbine flow on which algoritam of nozzle selection is deactivated.","560":"Maximal turbine flow","561":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 1 at which nozzle 2 is deactivated.","562":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 1 at which nozzle 2 is activated.","563":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 2 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","564":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 2 at which nozzle 3 is deactivated.","565":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 2 at which nozzle 3 is activated.","566":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 3 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","567":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 3 at which nozzle 4 is deactivated.","568":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 3 at which nozzle 4 is activated.","569":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 4 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","570":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 4 at which nozzle 5 is deactivated.","571":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 4 at which nozzle 5 is activated.","572":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 5 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","573":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 5 at which nozzle 6 is deactivated.","574":"Value that declares a position of nozzle 5 at which nozzle 6 is activated.","575":"Value that is added to \u0022Nozzle 6 deactivation point\u0022 to guard system from unexpected activations/deactivations of certain nozzles.","576":"","577":"","578":"","579":"","580":"","581":"","582":"","583":"","584":"","585":"","586":"","587":"","588":"","589":"","590":"","591":"","592":"","593":"","594":"","595":"","596":"","597":"","598":"","599":"","600":"","601":"","602":"","603":"","604":"","605":"","606":"","607":"","608":"Low limit of output value.","609":"High limit of output value.","610":"Limit for slew rate of the output value in second in positive range with falling absolute value.","611":"Limit for slew rate of the output value in second in positive range with rising absolute value.","612":"Limit for slew rate of the output value in second in positive range with falling absolute value.","613":"Limit for slew rate of the output value in second in positive range with rising absolute value.","614":"If the input \u0022Enable manual mode\u0022 is set then the control loop is interrupted. A manual value \u2028is set as the manipulated value.","615":"The PID actions can be switched on and off individually in the PID algorithm. P-action is on when the \u0022Enable P-action\u0022 input is set.","616":"The PID actions can be switched on and off individually in the PID algorithm. I action is on when the input \u0022I-action on\u0022 is set.","617":"The output of the integral action can be frozen. For this the input \u0022I-action hold\u0022 must be set.","618":"The PID actions can be switched on and off individually in the PID algorithm. D-action is on when the ?input \u0022Enable D-action\u0022 is set.","619":"The \u0022number of cycles\u0022 in PID parameters refers to nu